  "id": "checklist-for-bill-drafting-structure",
  "level": 2,
  "title": "Checklist for Bill Drafting – Structure"
 },
 {
  "id": "title-o-includes-all-code-sections-amended-added-and-repeale",
  "level": 2,
  "title": " Title o Includes all code sections amended, added and repealed within the bill o Ascending order for code sections o References all clauses within the bill  Enacting clause (double check wording)  Current version of code sections  Code section placement  Numbering of subsections, paragraphs, etc.  Material to be deleted -- Strike-through  New material - Underscore  Catchlines -- Informative but short  Definitions -- Alphabetical order  Special constitutional and statutory provisions  Penalty provisions  Severability clause  Emergency clause  Effective date  Default is July 1  Other date as specified  Retroactive to January 1 for tax provisions based on calendar years (all retro effective dates require emergency clause)  Sunset Clause"
 },
